  "title": "United Arab Emirates: TotalEnergies Enters in the Bab Gas Cap Concession",
  "summary": "Paris, June 24, 2026 –TotalEnergies has signed its entry into the Bab Gas Cap Concession in Abu Dhabi, with a 10% interest, alongside ADNOC (60%), bp (10%), CNPC (8%), JODCO/INPEX (5%), ZhenHua (4%) and GS Energy (3%). This new concession, operated by ADNOC Onshore, will enable the partners to develop the large gas cap resources […]",
